sequenceDiagram
    participant KServe as KServe InferenceService
    participant ModelMesh as ModelMesh PayloadProcessor
    participant Client as Client (Dashboard/CLI)
    participant Prom as Prometheus / OCP Monitoring
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (loopback)
    participant Scheduler as Prometheus Scheduler<br/>asyncio (30s interval)
    participant Core as Core Metrics Library
    participant PromReg as Prometheus Gauge Registry
    participant Storage as Storage Interface
    participant PVC as PVC / HDF5
    participant MariaDB as MariaDB<br/>3306/TCP MySQL

    Note over KServe,MariaDB: Flow 1: Inference Data Ingestion (KServe)

    KServe->>KRBAC: POST / (cloud event)<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>TrustyAI: POST / (forward)<br/>HTTP/8080, loopback
    TrustyAI->>Storage: Reconcile input/output pair
    alt PVC mode
        Storage->>PVC: Write HDF5 dataset
    else MariaDB mode
        Storage->>MariaDB: INSERT (JSON+gzip)<br/>TLS optional, DB creds
    end

    Note over ModelMesh,MariaDB: Flow 2: Inference Data Ingestion (ModelMesh)

    ModelMesh->>KRBAC: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>TrustyAI: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>HTTP/8080, loopback
    TrustyAI->>Storage: Persist partial payload
    TrustyAI->>Storage: Reconcile if pair available
    alt PVC mode
        Storage->>PVC: Write HDF5 dataset
    else MariaDB mode
        Storage->>MariaDB: INSERT (JSON+gzip)
    end

    Note over Scheduler,MariaDB: Flow 3: Scheduled Metric Computation

    loop Every 30 seconds
        Scheduler->>Storage: Read inference data
        alt PVC mode
            Storage->>PVC: Read HDF5
            PVC-->>Storage: DataFrame
        else MariaDB mode
            Storage->>MariaDB: SELECT
            MariaDB-->>Storage: DataFrame
        end
        Storage-->>Scheduler: Inference data
        Scheduler->>Core: Compute metrics (SPD, DIR, KS...)
        Core-->>Scheduler: Metric values
        Scheduler->>PromReg: Update Gauge values<br/>(trustyai_spd, trustyai_dir, ...)
    end

    Prom->>KRBAC: GET /q/metrics<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>TrustyAI: GET /q/metrics<br/>HTTP/8080, loopback
    TrustyAI-->>KRBAC: OpenMetrics response
    KRBAC-->>Prom: trustyai_* gauges

    Note over Client,MariaDB: Flow 4: On-Demand Metric Request

    Client->>KRBAC: POST /metrics/group/fairness/spd<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>TrustyAI: POST /metrics/group/fairness/spd<br/>HTTP/8080, loopback
    TrustyAI->>Storage: Query inference data
    Storage-->>TrustyAI: DataFrame
    TrustyAI->>Core: Compute metric
    Core-->>TrustyAI: Result
    TrustyAI-->>KRBAC: JSON response
    KRBAC-->>Client: Metric result

    Note over Client,MariaDB: Flow 5: LM Evaluation Job

    participant LMEval as lm-eval subprocess
    participant LLM as LLM Inference Endpoint

    Client->>KRBAC: POST /eval/lm-evaluation-harness/job<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>TrustyAI: POST /eval/.../job<br/>HTTP/8080, loopback
    TrustyAI->>LMEval: Launch subprocess<br/>(sanitized env, no secrets)
    LMEval->>LLM: HTTP/HTTPS requests<br/>API key auth (env var)
    LLM-->>LMEval: Inference responses
    LMEval-->>TrustyAI: Evaluation results
    TrustyAI-->>KRBAC: Job status
    KRBAC-->>Client: Job result
